Foundation, under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The accepted unrotated
geometry mass properties and the admission checks continue to use the separately
attributed maintained Parry dependency.

The private automatic-inertia Euler rotation compatibility boundary is adapted
from gz-math include/gz/math/Quaternion.hh and Matrix3.hh, Copyright (C) 2012
Open Source Robotics Foundation, under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Only newly rotated automatic box/sphere values also use private SDK-ordered
primitive evaluation adapted from gz-math include/gz/math/MassMatrix3.hh,
Copyright (C) 2015 Open Source Robotics Foundation, under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The demonstrated library rounding gap and this narrow exception are
recorded in docs/AUTO_ROTATION_POSE.md. Existing Parry admission and unrotated
paths, maintained glam matrix operations and the numeric policies remain in use;
no general geometry, rotation or inertia API is introduced.
